OL,3,ASurvivors of Uganda's deadly landslide
OL,4,Aseek justice at the UN
OL,5,
OL,6,FSurvivors of a 2019 landslide in
OL,7,Feastern Uganda that killed more than 50
OL,8,Fpeople have taken their fight for
OL,9,Frelocation and compensation to the
OL,10,FUnited Nations.
OL,12,FThe 48 complainants accuse the
OL,13,Fgovernment of violating Uganda's
OL,14,Fconstitution by failing to put
OL,15,Feffective disaster management measures
OL,16,Fin Bududa, a mountainous district prone
OL,17,Fto landslides.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
