OL,3,ASurvivors of Uganda's deadly landslide
OL,4,Aseek justice at the UN
OL,5,
OL,6,FTheir case comes as heavy rains raise
OL,7,Fthe risk of further landslides. They
OL,8,Fsay the government relocation programme
OL,9,Fignores their safety, land rights and
OL,10,Flivelihoods.
OL,12,FThe UN Human Rights Committee is
OL,13,Fconsidering what is believed to be the
OL,14,Ffirst case seeking climate adaptation
OL,15,Fmeasures, one that could set a global
OL,16,Fprecedent.
